@Media.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5088

### Upload an image (file name and content type are derived server-side)
POST {{Media.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/media-assets
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----RespiraBoundary

------RespiraBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="avatar.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./avatar.png
------RespiraBoundary--

###
